# Reglas de Testing — LTI

## Principio: TDD siempre

1. Escribe el test → verifica que FALLA
2. Implementa el mínimo código para que PASE
3. Refactoriza si procede
4. Repite

**Nunca** escribas código antes que el test.

## Naming de Tests

```typescript
// Patrón: should_[resultado]_when_[condición]
it('should_create_candidate_when_all_required_fields_are_valid', ...)
it('should_throw_error_when_email_has_invalid_format', ...)
it('should_return_null_when_candidate_not_found', ...)
```

## Estructura AAA

```typescript
it('should_...', async () => {
  // Arrange — preparar datos y mocks
  const dto = { firstName: 'Ana', email: 'ana@test.com' };
  jest.spyOn(Candidate.prototype, 'save').mockResolvedValue(new Candidate({ id: 1, ...dto }));

  // Act — ejecutar la acción bajo test
  const result = await candidateService.addCandidate(dto);

  // Assert — verificar el resultado
  expect(result.id).toBe(1);
  expect(result.email).toBe('ana@test.com');
});
```

## Mocking de Prisma (Backend)

```typescript
jest.mock('../../infrastructure/prismaClient', () => ({
  getPrismaClient: jest.fn().mockReturnValue({
    candidate: {
      create: jest.fn(),
      findUnique: jest.fn(),
      findMany: jest.fn(),
      update: jest.fn(),
      delete: jest.fn(),
    },
  }),
}));
```

## Mocking de Servicios (Frontend)

```typescript
jest.mock('../../services/candidateService');

beforeEach(() => jest.clearAllMocks());

(candidateService.addCandidate as jest.Mock).mockResolvedValue({ id: 1, ... });
(candidateService.addCandidate as jest.Mock).mockRejectedValue(new Error('Error message'));
```

## Cobertura Mínima: 90%

```bash
# Backend
cd backend && npm run test:coverage
# Frontend
cd frontend && npm test -- --coverage --watchAll=false
```

Verificar que **branches, functions, lines, statements** son todos >= 90%.

## Agrupación de Tests

```typescript
describe('CandidateService', () => {
  describe('addCandidate', () => {
    describe('when data is valid', () => {
      it('should_create_candidate', ...)
    });
    describe('when email is invalid', () => {
      it('should_throw_validation_error', ...)
    });
  });
});
```
